> Using the window structure software, all analysis results are saved in the default directory. How can I do the same here to save all my files in the default directory after completing all analyses? How can I  add my population name later and generate structure bar plot for particular cluster/group of K4 (when Delta K results are very precise)   and also other K3 to K5 where DeltK results are not precise and show structure between K3-K5.
